OL,3,GNEWSA'Our town is a good vibe - if you
OL,4,Aknow where to look'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt 21 years old Jack Townsend is
OL,7,Falready doing it all - rapping,
OL,8,Fwriting, producing and running a
OL,9,Fproject designed to help connect young
OL,10,Fartists - alongside best friend Yannick
OL,11,FManhica.
OL,13,FUnder the OPB Studios name, the pair
OL,14,Fhost an open-mic night in Bournemouth,
OL,15,Fwhich is running all month after its
OL,16,Frelaunch at the Helch Market venue.
OL,18,FThe events helps connect talent in the
OL,19,Farea and have introduced a space where
OL,20,Fpeople "feel they can belong," says
OL,21,FYannick.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
